      <title>MCP 本地方案如何终结重复上传截图的 Token 浪费</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260902/MCP-%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%BB%88%E7%BB%93%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE%E7%9A%84-Token-%E6%B5%AA%E8%B4%B9/</link>
